{"id":36467,"vol":{"id":3778,"name":"Adventures of Superman"},"num":"497","name":"Under Fire","title":"Adventures of Superman #497","year":"1992","date":"1992-12-31","store":"","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/11112/111120209/5934465-aos%20%23497%20final.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/11112/111120209/5934465-aos%20%23497%20final.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"Doomsday cuts a path from Ohio to New York. Superman and the Justice League America do everything thing to stop this monster and keep civilians safe at the same time. One by one the Justice League is taken out of action and it looks like Doomsday will rule the day. How many will die before the battle is over? Meanwhile Lex Luthor II and Supergirl look on at the battle and Luthor convinces her to stay with him in Metropolis.\n\nNotes:","people":[{"id":23086,"name":"Albert DeGuzman","role":"letterer"},{"id":13005,"name":"Denis Rodier","role":"cover"},{"id":19236,"name":"Doug Hazlewood","role":"inker, cover"},{"id":13063,"name":"Glenn Whitmore","role":"colorist"},{"id":43299,"name":"Jennifer Frank","role":"editor"},{"id":2908,"name":"Jerry Ordway","role":"writer"},{"id":41784,"name":"Mike Carlin","role":"editor"},{"id":4806,"name":"Tom Grummett","role":"penciler, cover"}],"chars":[{"id":1807,"name":"Superman","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11174/111743204/9725017-actioncomics%231081davidtalaski.jpg"},{"id":4439,"name":"Fire","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/8538359-ezgif-4-4a6d7bffc9.jpg"},{"id":1808,"name":"Lois Lane","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/11156/111564182/10043991-action-comics-1100_oto_talaski-large.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":41233,"name":"\"Superman\" Death of Superman"}]}